 "title": "Treasurer – Rush County Indiana Government",
 "text": "Treasurer – Rush County Indiana Government\nSkip to content\nMenu\nPay Taxes Online\nCounty Offices Info and Contact ↓\nA.D.A. and Title VI\nAssessor\nAuditor\nCircuit Court\nClerk\nCommissioners\nCoroner\nCounty Council\nCourt Services\nElection Info\nEMA\nExtension\nGeographic Info Sys\nHealth Dept\nHighway\nHuman Resources\nInfo Tech\nPlanning and Zoning\nProsecutor\nPublic Defender\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSolid Waste District\nSuperior Court\nSurveyor\nTownship Trustees\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Officer\nCalendar Current Updates\nCommunity Resources\nLegal Notices Click Here\nWeather / Emergency Alerts\nHealth Complaint Form\nPhone Directory\n101 E. 2nd St, Rushville, IN 46173\nOpen Search Window\nHome\nTreasurer\nTreasurer\nTreasurer\nSusan Spaeth\n.\nThe county treasurer is elected by vote of the county at large for a term of four years with a prohibition against serving more than two terms within twelve years.\nContact Information\nRush County Courthouse\n101 East Second Street, Room 213\nRushville, Indiana 46173\nPhone: 765-932-2386\nFax: 765-938-1163\nEmail: treasurer@rushcounty.in.gov\nOffice Hours: Monday through Friday 8 AM – 4 PM EST\nStaff:\nMissy Fizer, Deputy\nKiersten Houchins, Deputy\nPrimary duties of the Treasurer are to:\nThe county treasurer is responsible for collecting taxes; and in the case of delinquent taxes, the treasurer may order the sale of real property to pay delinquent taxes. The treasurer also receives distributions of local income and other taxes that are collected by the state such as real estate tax, personal property tax, mobile home tax, state assessed tax, and the following miscellaneous taxes: auto excise tax.\nAs an officer on the County Board of Finance, the treasurer is responsible to deposit, invest, and account for all monies entrusted to Rush County government. Together with the auditor, the treasurer ensures the proper distribution of funds. (Generally see IC 36-2-19 for duties of the county treasurer).\nSource: “Guide to Indiana County Government” 2007 edition; Association of Indiana Counties, Inc.\nLinks / Info\nPAY PROPERTY TAXES ONLINE\nIndiana State Treasurer’s Office\nAssociation of Indiana Counties\nIndiana Treasurers Association\nNational Association of Counties\nJoin us in Rush County Indiana\nWe can't wait to see you!\nCounty Offices\nLinks/Resources\nRush County Courthouse\n101 E 2nd St • Rushville, IN 46173\nMonday – Friday, 8:00 am – 4:00 pm\n(Individual office hours may vary)\nCounty Offices\nList of County Offices\nGIS Online\nRush County GIS\nQuick Links\nLinks/Resources\nDoculivery\nOpen Search Window\nLive here. Play here. Thrive here.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nCopyright © 2021 - Rush County Indiana Government\nSearch for:\nSearch\nClose Search Window\n↑",
